# Brand studio

Local Next app at `apps/brand` (port 3100). Not docs — no nav links, sitemap entries, or docs Vercel routing.

Canvases: `src/sections/{section}/stills|videos/`. Register in `catalog.ts` + `registry.ts`. Do not commit PNG/MP4 under `public/` unless a published surface will serve that file. Never commit MP4. Do not leave `@editframe/*` or `shadcn add` dumps in `package.json` / the lockfile unless asked.

**When adding a still or video, Read** [docs/agents/brand.md](docs/agents/brand.md).
